Are you an existing client looking to access your policy information or are you interested in finding out about Clientèle products? If you fall in either one of these categories, look no further than the Clientèle App.

With this App, you will have access to all our key functionalities at your fingertips and from the comfort of your home or office. This is convenience at its best, with just a few clicks, you will be able to perform key functions on this App.

At the core of our strategy as a business, is the need to enhance and improve our client experience and this App will help us do just that.

Download the Clientèle App where you will be able to do the following:
 • Get up to date information on our products and exciting loyalty benefit, Clientèle Rewards;
 • Add Clientèle Rewards to an existing policy;
 • Access and redeem your monthly Clientèle Rewards, these include savings on groceries, bus tickets, store gift cards and many other special offers;
 • Add a product or manage your existing policy;
 • Download your policy documentation and;
 • Submit a claim 24/7;
 • Buy your Clientèle Mobile SIM card and purchase discounted airtime & data.

Do you need assistance with using some of the features within the App? No problem, simply go to ‘Help’. Here you will access useful information that will guide you through the App. This App, is simple, easy, extremely user friendly and can be used immediately.

If you are an agent, log on to the App to access a digital sales platform where you can submit your applications digitally on the same day!

You can install the App on your smartphone or tablet. Once downloaded the App is free to use on all major SA networks, this means that Clientèle will pay for all the data that the App uses.

Download the Clientèle App now.

This is another initiative brought to you by CBC Rewards (Pty) Ltd.

Disclaimer: Clientèle Rewards is an optional loyalty benefit offered by CBC Rewards (Pty) Ltd.

Cash Passport™, Mastercard®, is designed to help you Outsmart Travel. 

Cash Passport is a reloadable, multicurrency prepaid travel money card – which helps take the stress out of spending internationally.

Here’s how:

-	Cash Passport is more secure than carrying cash;
-	It’s accepted in millions of places (everywhere Mastercard is accepted);
-	It allows you to load multiple currencies;
-	It gives you the ability to lock-in exchange rates so you’ll know exactly how much money you have to spend; and
-	24/7 phone support to all Cash Passport customers no matter where you are in the world.

The smarter and savvier new app comes with improved usability and added functionality, so you can spend more time holidaying. 

Key features:

-	Touch ID for fast and secure sign in;
-	Real time view of your balance(s);
-	Instantly transfer between currencies;
-	Reload your card (where in-app top-ups are allowed);
-	Monitor your transactions and spending; and
-	Manage your personal and card details.

To find out more about Cash Passport and outsmarting travel, visit CashPassport.com

With Telkom Pay, you can make payments, get paid, send money, buy prepaid, store vouchers, and more. Manage your money in your Telkom Pay wallet; you don't need a bank account. You also don't need to be a Telkom customer to use the app; it works on all network providers.

 

Sign up is easy. Verify your identity through a KYC (Know Your Customer) process for your safety. This process is done on your phone with no paperwork or branch visits. All you need to do is upload your South African identity document, valid passport or driver's license. If you are not a South African citizen, you can upload your valid foreign passport or asylum document. You will also take a 'selfie' for your security to ensure you are who you say you are. Verification is instant, and if successful, you will be able to start transacting immediately.

 

Telkom Pay Features

 

Receive money and make payments from your wallet;

Top up your wallet by making an EFT bank transfer, a linked bank card, cash at a Pick a Pay, or a Nedbank ATM;

Make a withdrawal by EFT, immediate EFT, cash at a Pick a Pay, or Cash Express ATM;

Get paid by showing your QR code;

Send or request money from friends and family;

Pay any Scan to Pay or Snapscan QR codes;

Easily create a virtual prepaid card for secure online purchases;

Make EFT bank transfers to your own or someone else's bank account;

Buy airtime, data, electricity or store and entertainment vouchers;

View all payments made or received in your transaction history;

Earn money to buy airtime by referring a friend.
